{
  "summary": "Configure functional test nodes' `noban_tx_relay` whitelist setting via `extra_confs` rather than command-line `extra_args`. This ensures that whitelisting without transaction relay delays persists across node restarts even when test cases restart nodes with custom `extra_args`.",
  "problem": "When a functional test node is restarted with custom `extra_args`, its original command-line arguments are replaced. As a result, nodes configured with `noban_tx_relay` lose the `-whitelist=noban,in,out@127.0.0.1` setting upon restarting, falling back to standard transaction relay delays and slowing down tests.",
  "evidence": [
    "Author's local benchmarks across functional tests (`test_runner.py -j=18 --randomseed=1`) show execution time reductions: mempool_ephemeral_dust.py dropped from 49s to 18s, mempool_accept_wtxid.py from 17s to 6s, wallet_fundrawtransaction.py from 11s to 7s, and total wall time decreased from 80s to 75s."
